Here is a script that denies access to a website or service:
```
// Deny access to a website or service
if (request.url.path == "/construction") {
 response.status = 403
 response.body = "Access denied. This website is under construction."
}
```
This script uses the `if` statement to check if the URL path of the incoming request is equal to "/construction". If it is, it sets the HTTP status code to 403 (Forbidden) and

